   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi fRiends,<div><br></div><div>The Davis R Users Group will hold its regularly scheduled weekly meeting 10am-12pm next Wednesday, October 13. The meeting will begin with a short presentation on the topics of factor coding, contrasts, and examining model fits with the emmeans package. The goal is to explain how R handles factor variables, and how to interpret models that use factors. The meeting will be hybrid-virtual, with attendance in-person at room 360 Shields Library or virtually over Zoom. Our presenter is Wesley Brooks, statistician at the UC Davis DataLab. Following the presentation, there will be free time to co-work and/or ask questions of other R Users.<font color=\"#888888\"><br></font><div><br></div><div>Best wishes,</div><div>Your D-RUG Coo[R]dinators</div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Christian John — Ph.D. candidate</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">NASA FINESST Future Investigator</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Pronouns: he/him/his</span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><div><a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;user=VPd60tMAAAAJ&amp;view_op=list_works&amp;authuser=1&amp;sortby=pubdate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl%3Den%26user%3DVPd60tMAAAAJ%26view_op%3Dlist_works%26authuser%3D1%26sortby%3Dpubdate&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465152957000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2rgZ2ij4oZFb2SD97Ap11B\">Google S